file-tui is a modified version of file-browser-tui by adelmonte
https://github.com/adelmonte/file-browser-tui

Changed on 2026-11-05: renamed the project; plain text and menus for Ghostty;
full sidebar highlight; larger sidebar icons; fixed the icon temp-file race;
lower idle redraw rate; permanent delete inside Trash.

Changed on 2026-11-06: fixed a crash when opening an empty folder; Ctrl+C quits
and Alt+C copies; files can be dragged onto Places and Trash; files dropped from
other windows in Ghostty ask to move, copy or link; pasted text no longer runs
shortcuts; t trashes, dd deletes, n makes a folder, Ctrl+N makes a file; the
name box says why a name was refused; smaller folder icons in the icon view;
Ctrl+D drags files out to other apps with ripdrag; text icons with F9, --text or
text_only, and by default in terminals without images; Shift+F10 opens the
context menu; fewer worker threads, smaller icon cache, no redraw while idle.

